@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸～诺亚做不到～<br>诺亚已经期待得不得了了嘛。|#0203Bad01_Noah003| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:唔唔……|#0203Bad01_AnAn004| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:安安把小说写出来以后，<br>诺亚会给小说画很多很多插画！|#0203Bad01_Noah004| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗也请期待一下哦。|#0203Bad01_Noah005| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，无论是小说还是插画，我都很期待能早日看到。|#0203Bad01_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在那以后，<br>她们两个一直热烈讨论者小说跟插画的话题。|#0203Bad01_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

