[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚正在画室里，看起来心情特别好。<br>还有安安，两眼正闪着激动的光。|#0203Bad01_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@EmoteJumpDouble ActorIds:Noah Loop:false Speed:1

[PrintTextModified Text:你听诺亚说！<br>安安的小说超级有趣哦！|#0203Bad01_Noah007| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以啊，<br>诺亚现在正在给小说画一张又一张插画！|#0203Bad01_Noah008| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来她们的工作重心<br>已经从舞台剧制作转移到小说创作上。|#0203Bad01_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:工作台上散落着一张张<br>写满文字的纸张跟画了图案的画纸。|#0203Bad01_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚真厉害。<br>这就是吾辈想像里的景象。|#0203Bad01_AnAn006| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安看起来十分感动。<br>她正目不转睛地盯着诺亚的画作。|#0203Bad01_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:呵呵，好高兴～<br>但这还不算成品哦。|#0203Bad01_Noah009| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:什么意思？|#0203Bad01_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚现在就来收尾～|#0203Bad01_Noah010| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@EmoteJump ActorIds:Noah Loop:false Speed:1

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_34_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:喜笑颜开的诺亚拿起画笔划了几下后，<br>画里描绘的生物就逐一化为实体，<br>从纸面上跃出。|#0203Bad01_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看起来和真正存在的生物无异。|#0203Bad01_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这是……|#0203Bad01_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:不管看几次都觉得好厉害。|#0203Bad01_AnAn007| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:对吧对吧～？|#0203Bad01_Noah011| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:长角的兔子，气质神圣的白蛇。<br>除此以外，还有拥有锐利脚爪的飞鸟，<br>长得像龙的奇幻生物。|#0203Bad01_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:化为实体的那群生物就像跟诺亚和安安撒娇一般<br>往她们身上靠。|#0203Bad01_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:其实啊，<br>除了这些小家伙以外还有其他动物哦。|#0203Bad01_Noah012| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是吗？|#0203Bad01_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯！<br>诺亚从好几天前开始就跟安安一起想了好多，<br>也画出来好多。|#0203Bad01_Noah013| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@EmoteJumpDouble ActorIds:Noah Loop:false Speed:1

[PrintTextModified Text:对不对～安安？|#0203Bad01_Noah014| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊，今天让它们守房间里去了。|#0203Bad01_AnAn008| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，<br>可诺亚刚才回房间的时候不小心放走了几只……|#0203Bad01_Noah015| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:应该也有几只动物正在<br>房子里玩耍吧。|#0203Bad01_Noah016| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那等会还是去抓回来比较好。|#0203Bad01_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（不过，看起来也没有什么特别危险的动物，<br>　应该用不着太担心……）|#0203Bad01_Hiro011|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:看见少女和可爱生物嬉戏的温馨画面，<br>我的心也不由得放松了下来。|#0203Bad01_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只是有一件事让我感到有些顾虑。|#0203Bad01_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Surprised1

