@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Noah

[PrintTextModified Text:安安……？|#0203Bad01_Noah024| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大概是无法接受<br>眼前突如其来的惨剧，<br>安安当场呕吐了起来。|#0203Bad01_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:绞杀了艾玛的白蛇也来到了<br>我的面前。|#0203Bad01_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Surprised

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，快逃！|#0203Bad01_Noah025| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（我是想逃，可是……！）|#0203Bad01_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:杀死了汉娜的龙就盘踞在门口，<br>围在诺亚跟安安身边的其他野兽也一直<br>对这边虎视眈眈。|#0203Bad01_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（该怎么办……）|#0203Bad01_Hiro017| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我有死亡回溯的魔法，<br>只要死了事情总能应付过去，<br>但诺亚应该是在几天前就开始画这些生物的画了。|#0203Bad01_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（要是这样的话，就算通过死亡回溯到过去，<br>　它们也早就存在于监牢之内……）|#0203Bad01_Hiro018|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

