[PrintTextModified Text:我想不到任何办法，<br>跟艾玛一样被白蛇缠住了脖子。|#0203Bad01_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆首を絞められて

[PrintTextModified Text:唔，呃……|#0203Bad01_Hiro019| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:好痛苦，好痛苦好痛苦好痛苦——|#0203Bad01_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不要！希罗……希罗！|#0203Bad01_Noah026| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚想要冲过来，<br>却受到围绕在她身边的野兽<br>阻挡。|#0203Bad01_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#FFFFFFFF Duration:15 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay

[PrintTextModified Text:一群神圣的野兽守卫着她们两人。<br>那个画面美丽得有如神话中的一幕。|#0203Bad01_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:明明是那么凄惨的时刻，<br>我的心情却宛如心灵得到洗涤一般圣洁。|#0203Bad01_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（啊啊，<br>　你们真的成就了一部杰作啊——）|#0203Bad01_Hiro020|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:眼前无法回避的事态让我感到深深的绝望，<br>但我依然带着满足的笑容咽下了最后一口气。|#0203Bad01_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

